Types.Pose:
  type: struct
  description: The current position of the object reference point on vehicle axis according to ISO 23150:2023.
Types.Pose.X:
  datatype: int16
  type: property
  unit: mm
  description: Longitudinal position of object reference point measured on the X-axis of the vehicle rear-axle coordinate system as defined by ISO 23150:2023. The object reference point refers to a representative point of the object. Positive values = forward of (first) rear-axle. Negative values = backward of (first) rear-axle.
Types.Pose.Y:
  datatype: int16
  type: property
  unit: mm
  description: Lateral position of object reference point measured on the Y-axis of the vehicle rear-axle coordinate system as defined by ISO 23150:2023. The object reference point refers to a representative point of the object. Positive values = left of rear-axle center. Negative values = right of rear-axle center.
Types.Pose.Z:
  datatype: int16
  type: property
  unit: mm
  description: Height position of object reference point measured on the Z-axis of the vehicle rear-axle coordinate system as defined by ISO 23150:2023. The object reference point refers to a representative point of the object. Positive values = above center of rear-axle reference point. Negative values = below center of rear-axle reference point.
Types.Pose.Yaw:
  datatype: float
  type: property
  min: -180
  max: 180
  unit: degrees
  description: Object yaw angle, measured from the vehicle sprung mass X-axis as defined by ISO 23150:2023 to the object X-axis, around the vehicle Z-axis (right-hand rule). 0 = Object in nominal orientation. Positive values = Object rotated left. Negative values = Object rotated right.
Types.Pose.Pitch:
  datatype: float
  type: property
  min: -90
  max: 90
  unit: degrees
  description: Object pitch angle, measured as angle from vehicle sprung mass XY-plane as defined by ISO 23150:2023 to the object X-axis. 0 = Object in nominal orientation. Positive values = Object tilted up. Negative values = Object tilted down.
Types.Pose.Roll:
  datatype: float
  type: property
  min: -180
  max: 180
  unit: degrees
  description: Object roll angle about the object X-axis (right-hand rule). 0 = Object in nominal orientation. Positive values = Object tilted to the right. Negative values = Object tilted to the left.
